# Text files are stored and checked out with LF line endings on every machine.
# Windows' default (core.autocrlf true) checks them out as CRLF, which broke scripts that match
# "\n" (scripts/decisions.mjs failed every entry) and turned one-line edits into whole-file diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never converted
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
